# Density Compare
# Nihonium (Nh) — real density 16 g/cm³. equal masses: Nihonium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Nihonium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.9mm color: #ff3060 at (-20mm, 4.0mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 127.6 g — the water cube is the reference
